    {"type": "judgement", "text": "This is a capital-intensity signal rather than an earnings-quality one, since operating cash flow still covered net income 1.37x [D459]."},
    {"type": "fact", "text": "FY2017 pretax income, tax and receivables were later restated, so FY2017 comparisons use first-reported values [R2][R3][R4][X95][X105][X213]."},
